{
  "slug": "tempeh-mushroom-breakfast-skillet",
  "name": "Tempeh and mushroom breakfast skillet",
  "description": "Crumbled tempeh dry-fried with mushrooms, diced potato and spinach in one pan — the tempeh brings enough of its own fat that no cooking oil is needed.",
  "iconKey": "pot",
  "instructions": [
    "Dice the potato small and cook it in a dry nonstick pan over medium heat, covered, for 8 minutes, turning twice.",
    "Crumble the tempeh into the pan, add the onion and cook uncovered for 4 minutes, until both are lightly browned.",
    "Add the mushrooms, the salt and the black pepper and cook for 5 minutes, until the mushrooms are golden.",
    "Fold in the spinach and cook for 1 minute, just until it wilts.",
    "Divide between two plates and serve hot."
